| :--- | ---: | ---: | :--- | ---: |
| zero RHS | 0 | 0 | true | 0.000000 |
| one-step budget | 1 | 2 | false | 0.559017 |
| negative curvature | 0 | 1 | false | 1.000000 |

Negative curvature has explicit reason: true.
A 15-entry trace cap rejects the 16-entry two-step history.
